      "text": "Defending America’s territorial integrity through layered border security.\n \nOver the weekend, @USCG Cutters Forrest Rednour and Haddock, alongside @USNavy and @DHS partner agencies, interdicted multiple vessels north of the Maritime Boundary Line and embarked 82 aliens attempting unlawful entry.\n \nAlways ready, Coast Guard men and women continue operations to control, secure, and defend U.S. borders and maritime approaches, where defense of America begins.\n \nRead more here: https://t.co/0P9vvj0e2R\n\n#USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #EveryWarEveryShore",
      "text_resolved": "Defending America’s territorial integrity through layered border security.\n \nOver the weekend, @USCG Cutters Forrest Rednour and Haddock, alongside @USNavy and @DHS partner agencies, interdicted multiple vessels north of the Maritime Boundary Line and embarked 82 aliens attempting unlawful entry.\n \nAlways ready, Coast Guard men and women continue operations to control, secure, and defend U.S. borders and maritime approaches, where defense of America begins.\n \nRead more here: https://www.news.uscg.mil/Press-Releases/Article/4413264/coast-guard-and-department-of-homeland-security-partner-agencies-interdict-mult/\n\n#USCG #MaritimeSecurity #ImmigrationEnforcement #EveryWarEveryShore",
