      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "A successful counter-drug patrol for the crew of @USCG Cutter Richard Etheridge! Last week, they seized 174 pounds of cocaine and 17 pounds of marijuana—valued at $1.3 million—following the interdiction of a vessel eight nautical miles off Miami Beach.\n \n80 percent of all U.S.-bound drug seizures occur at sea versus land, underscoring the impact of Coast Guard maritime interdiction and seamless teamwork with our partners @CBP and @HSI_HQ.\n \nAs a shield of sovereignty, our maritime fighting force stands Always Ready to secure our borders and approaches and protect the American people.\n \nRead more at: https://t.co/53NtUYY3MA\n\n#DrugInterdiction #SemperParatus #USCG\n@DHSgov @USCGSoutheast",
