      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Restoring American maritime dominance in regions of strategic importance – no matter how harsh or remote. Our icebreakers are carving paths for U.S. national security and scientific discovery through feet of solid ice.\n\nFor 50 years, #USCG Cutter Polar Star has been the key to this mission. Success here relies on the unparalleled skill of our ice pilots, who navigate the formidable waters of #OperationDeepFreeze. Through historic investment in the One Big Beautiful Bill Act, the Coast Guard is accelerating these operations by recapitalizing our icebreaker fleet.\n\nHear from Lt. Cmdr. Daniel Jones on what it takes to be at the helm:\n\n@USCGPACAREA",
