      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "1,000+ interdictions. 26 years of operational impact. One mission: save lives and protect the American people.\n \nAs a crucial part of @USCG's mission to secure our maritime borders, HITRON was created to counter the unique threat of high-speed smuggling vessels. This elite helicopter squadron acts as a \"force from above,\" employing specialized tactics to ensure no threat outruns the law. Their success is a direct reflection of the Coast Guard's unwavering commitment to protecting the American people and stopping illicit narcotics before they reach our shores.\n \nWatch HITRON in action.\n#HITRON #USCG #maritimesecurity #druginterdiction\n@DHSgov",
