      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Same mission, new look.\n\nOur elite Helicopter Interdiction Tactical Squadron (HITRON) is getting a fresh paint job across all its MH-65 Dolphins. The new “Blackfin” on the 65s’ rudder commemorates HITRON’s most successful fiscal year on record, and the milestone of surpassing 1,000 interdictions. Through a year where @USCG seized 511K+ lbs of cocaine – 3X our annual average – HITRON has been the tip of the spear.\n\nLook sharp, fly sharp. #SemperParatus\n\n#HITRON #maritimesecurity #druginterdiction\n@DHSgov",
